{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "8c0c5068437297ddf01fd3837522b455f4b5e6600f0f9cd2b20facf989edccbe", "ja": "いつもの765プロとはちょっと違う？とある\n765プロの桃子、環、育。緊張している所に\nやってきた、アイドル達との一幕です。", "zh": "和往常的765事务所稍微有点不同？身处某个\n765事务所的桃子、环、育。在这感到紧张之处\n造访的偶像们，与她们之间的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1000_null", "source_sha256": "e15933af988fd36c661cc948b42718615323b3c762e69612ebe82d349721b8ec", "ja": "これは、いつもの765プロとはちょっと\n違うかもしれない、とある765プロのお話……", "zh": "这是一个或许和往常的765制作人有些不同的，某位765制作人的故事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1001_404apr", "source_sha256": "c175c467a0dc20699e26bc1a2d297e12f7cf524fe45adecd3f791285a6343370", "ja": "おっと、もうこんな時間か～。\nそろそろ開演だけど、3人とも準備はいいか？", "zh": "哎呀，已经这个时间了吗～  \n差不多要开演了，3人都准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "c62c3abecd6378142ee7c79b828565c2aa73ace86478f2599145ca3765e7faa4", "ja": "お兄ちゃん、誰に聞いてるのよ。桃子たちなら、\nとっくに準備できてるんだから。ね？　環、育。", "zh": "哥哥，你是在问谁啊？桃子她们早就准备好了。对吧，环、育。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "92213391336711ce08b7dddca4c66addfda576bca8d713eb693be0fca23e55f9", "ja": "うん！　たまき、昨日から準備できてる！\n楽しみだったから！", "zh": "嗯！环从昨天起就准备好了！因为一直很期待嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "cfd07f38dea2a15dc209dcdf142a67552d2d274315b790c5c07592a14e075ff2", "ja": "わたしも！\nすごくどきどきしてるけど、楽しみ……♪", "zh": "我也是！\n虽然特别紧张，但好期待……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1005_404apr", "source_sha256": "01a6b3716853b65945dec86ff4fcbd6285c614ad58a5f15d38cccb79c9fb43ff", "ja": "そうか～。3人とも、準備がいいな～。\n今日はみんなのための、特設ステージだし……。", "zh": "这样啊～。3个人都准备得很充分嘛～。\n今天可是为大家准备的特别舞台……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1006_404apr", "source_sha256": "0aed9b7689f96d1caca6bf9b9a444b1a2459135bb479b2d709497482ed094f0f", "ja": "お客さん達、びっくりすると思うぞ～。", "zh": "客人们肯定会大吃一惊的～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1007_049mom", "source_sha256": "6513b6553f1fdcb186b53aaf1510ffe93d3965597640c5277817c712f7531b44", "ja": "う……も、もう！　ヘンなプレッシャーかけないで！\nふたりとも、気にしなくていいからね。練習どおり……", "zh": "呜……真、真是的！别给人施加奇怪的压力啦！\n你们两个，不用放在心上哦。只要像平时练习的那样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1008_se", "source_sha256": "632766b1963bbd5d65cd118f29217ec32140023fcf0802dafb4fd7ef14cacead", "ja": "パタパタパタ……", "zh": "啪哒啪哒啪哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "0f186d3e16ec2f80aee4be54427b4ac4c32dc54bc31a237157a1ba34ab34e31e", "ja": "プロデューサー！　そろそろ舞台袖に移動を……\nあら！　3人とも、すっごく可愛いじゃない！", "zh": "制作人！差不多该移动到舞台侧台了……\n哎呀！3个人都超级可爱呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "08e3454a95377910cf96566267d811e6c3259c568508f3d04968e6b259b33c03", "ja": "うわぁ～……！　タコだ～！！！", "zh": "哇啊～……！是章鱼～！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "cb17b7f977adef1c834bf09dc09248f0e427e9286cb265284d5ccd6dcfa8c2bb", "ja": "へっ？　た、タコ……？", "zh": "诶？章、章鱼……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
