{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "72b441eb2d28e87cfebbb8992bd6311a344b22c58837c37b9c0aa29e020bacfc", "ja": "ふぉぉ～っ！　なんというリアル天使！！　ここは\n天国ですか！？　カメラカメラ……えっ、ない！？", "zh": "哦哦哦——！这也太像真的天使了吧！！这里是天堂吗！？相机相机……诶，没有！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "12d3ae7d3396a94138b844280ac28390618bda459495561e41de572430f0bc66", "ja": "そうでした、この衣装だと入れるところがなくて、\n楽屋に置いてきてッ……！　ありさ、一生の不覚です！", "zh": "对了，穿着这身衣服根本没地方放，我把相机落在休息室了……！这是亚利沙一生的失误！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "ec50d66bdf64fda743efe61ee0deb863fc9c0acf19d110423830e17861a080cb", "ja": "何言ってるんですか、亜利沙さん……。\nそれよりみんな、時間がないわ。行きましょう。", "zh": "您在说什么呢，亜利沙……\n比起这个，大家没时间了。走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "1f633492a5938d13dd9e8166bab229a28bcb1d46e46a344d2f2a693494bcb2c6", "ja": "しずか！\nこのみ、ありさも、すっごくカッコイイぞ～！", "zh": "静香！木实、亚利沙也都超帅气的哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "391f699cc1b28a21ac0a48d99879032aa20b99c6dbc946cb5b69167842ad914f", "ja": "プロデューサーさん。\nこの衣装って、わたしたちが海でお仕事した時の……？", "zh": "制作人。\n这套服装是我们之前在海边工作时穿的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1018_404apr", "source_sha256": "93144c70d1d942548cab38eaf48cbe1b8f64c8c3cb8048c2c034d1757e2c1aad", "ja": "ああ、今回のライブのスポンサーさんだからな！\n特別に衣装を作ってくれたんだ。全員分！", "zh": "啊，因为是这次演唱会的赞助商嘛！\n他们还特别为我们制作了演出服。每个人都有！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "6de4ac2b13c81b6fea79db41cf0cad21b10681c76d00a44b1d8bc549fdcd2e20", "ja": "全員分！？", "zh": "全员的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "eebc5070d65cc1db425e99d8fcd03a8e06781b65dd9a34e18ceb8cb527453f3d", "ja": "な、なに？　これもれっきとした衣装なんだから、\nちっとも変なんかじゃないわ。", "zh": "什、什么？这也是货真价实的演出服，才一点都不奇怪呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1021_028ari", "source_sha256": "34b3ab1dde34dc9970270693695470bfd4ca844b43875ea014c1eb4a33ef7d91", "ja": "静香ちゃん、さっきまでドアにかじりついていたとは\n思えません……。これぞプロの鑑！　胸熱ですぅ！", "zh": "真没想到静香刚才还一直扒着门不放……这才是真正的专业典范！热血沸腾啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "4cf258be3236ac1d9ca6a57f07ba8c8a056de0e6f5ccaf766f56ac30a92512d7", "ja": "は、恥ずかしくないって言ったらウソになりますけど。\n……みんなだって、これを着てお仕事したんでしょ？", "zh": "要说我一点都不害羞，那肯定是骗人的。\n……大家也是穿着这个去工作的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "2bb229b82077f4f30b72b5ae3fc47fb4a2e69fa69505332398c9dcc091821995", "ja": "だったら私たちが恥ずかしいなんて言ってられないわ。\nそうよね、亜利沙ちゃん！", "zh": "既然这样，我们就不能再说什么害羞了。  \n对吧，亚利沙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1024_028ari", "source_sha256": "0b13408b68fcaeb8235c12982160f32bae16f54645948b5c03beffbf9509c9ec", "ja": "はいっ！　それに、桃子ちゃんたちを\n一躍有名にした、ご利益のある衣装ですからね！", "zh": "是！而且这可是让桃子她们一举成名、带来好运的服装呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1025_028ari", "source_sha256": "da81e496ed6c74dcede7f8ef826e1f726deca51f77298933e637ea95bae48008", "ja": "今日のライブも成功間違いなしだと、\nありさは思います！", "zh": "亜利沙觉得，今天的演出也一定会成功！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1026_030iku", "source_sha256": "c4d18f7b689583b24b35fb13c97049f41fb40bfece03c7d631e1fd5123726dfc", "ja": "このみさん……静香さん、亜利沙さん、\n大人っぽい……かっこいい……！", "zh": "好美姐姐……静香姐姐、亚利沙姐姐，\n好成熟……好帅气……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1027_039kon", "source_sha256": "3211b195e5d53b4ad01b75f7ab56eb9c00a15af37833dc0ec95d05f059295e97", "ja": "すこし複雑だけど……でも、任せて！\n今日はアダルティな大人のタコで盛り上げてみせるわ！", "zh": "虽然有点复杂……不过，交给我吧！\n\n今天就用成熟大人的章鱼让大家尽兴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1028_039kon", "source_sha256": "c9f7165b2883660d54d7f66572af41c1222decab40ea5775b7fcfda5ddbc94a8", "ja": "やだ、なんかしょっぱいわね……。\nこれは、涙じゃないの。潮よ……！！", "zh": "哎呀，怎么感觉有点咸呢……这才不是眼泪，是海水啦……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1029_015siz", "source_sha256": "25829b155951f233f1eff445f9c222927ed36966fc801e4cd6f5269f24e0ea1e", "ja": "あ、プロデューサー。\n私、ステージが終わった後、話がありますから。", "zh": "啊，制作人。\n我演出结束后有话要跟你说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1030_039kon", "source_sha256": "ebd8cd12947f139e58b359179f18c967cecc331cc121f6cc3054af116a52c4ef", "ja": "あ、それは私もあるかもしれないわ。", "zh": "啊，那件事我可能也有话要说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_131_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_131_ng_01_1031_028ari", "source_sha256": "b634e6a8dcbe35334cb0c97b523edeb04540141d96aa2f29ad5c24c17aaacbef", "ja": "それならありさもご一緒します。", "zh": "那样的话，亚利沙也一起去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
